<h3>About Financial Accounting</h3>

<p>This collection contains the output from two OTC projects.</p>

<p><a href="https://opennj.net/AA00001550/00001">Financial Accounting I</a> provides an introduction to financial accounting, including balance sheets, the accounting cycle, receivables, and long-lived assets. The course consists of a downoadable textbook with text, self-check assignments, and comprehension problems, broken into ten chapters.</p>
<!--https://opennj.net/AA00001551/00001"-->

<p>Financial Accounting II, anticipated Fall 2023, includes an OER textbook, original content and remixed material for Financial Accounting II. 70+ short videos for each topic will enhance students&#39; understanding of the concepts.</p>

